**Given:**

a = 26 and b = 22

**Concept used:**

(a² - b²) = (a + b)(a - b)

(a - b)² = a² + b² - 2ab

(a3 - b3) = (a - b)(a² + b² + ab)

**Calculation:**

{{a³ - b³} over a² - b²}-{{3ab} over a + b}

⇒ {{a³ - b³} over (a + b)(a - b)}-{{3ab} over a + b}

⇒ {{(a - b)(a²+b²+ab)} over (a + b)(a - b)}-{{3ab} over a + b}

⇒ {{(a²+b²+ab)} over a + b}-{{3ab} over a + b}

⇒ {{a²+b²+ab-3ab} over a + b}

⇒ {{a²+b²-2ab} over a + b}

⇒ {{(a-b)²} over a + b}

⇒ {{(26-22)²} over 26 + 22}

⇒ {{4²} over 48}

⇒ {{16} over 48}

⇒ {{1} over 3}

**∴ The required answer is {{1} over 3}.**
